            "review_title": "Review at Lolla Saigon",
            "review_text": "Roger K\n1 contribution\n0\nBest meal of our trip.\nNov 2025 • Friends\nWhat a great restaurant!! My friend ordered the sea bass and I the Moroccan chicken. We both had a side of truffle mashed potatoes. Both meals were perfection. Not that I don’t like Vietnamese food, but this was the best meal of our trip. Service was so friendly and the owner/chef made a point to come talk with us. A great experience.\nWritten November 17, 2025",
